: <<'DOCUMENTATION'
SHELL_UTILS CHECK UPDATE
Enhanced with better error handling, index corruption recovery,
repository integrity verification, and defenses against local
tampering with the framework repository.

Design contract:
  - The core of the framework (~/.shell_utils) must always match the
    official upstream (felipefacundes/shell_utils).
  - Users are expected to place their own overrides in a separate
    directory that is sourced last by the framework, never inside the
    core tree.
  - Therefore, discarding local modifications to tracked files with
    'git reset --hard origin/main' is intentional and safe.
DOCUMENTATION

